{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00355","headline":"丈人观 · 蜀太后徐氏","name":"丈人观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早与元妃慕至化，同跻灵岳访真仙。\n当时信有壶中景，今日亲来洞里天。\n仪仗影空寥廓外，金丝声揭翠微巅。\n惟慙未致华胥理，徒卜升平万万年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蜀太后徐氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}